u to work off of, instead I'd like for you to create an original composition. Make it cutesy just like her!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 53772, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec16643e/uploads/origins/63572010-7dbf-4f3c-8d4c-fd265a25e005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5480da9c4b6e4d0627a558f2e1d4933b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec16643e/uploads/origins/63572010-7dbf-4f3c-8d4c-fd265a25e005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=30c081588bf53d77dcf80c4f1729d2cf", "src_set": ""}, "body": "OCのリミナリティのイラストが欲しいです。表情は「どうなんだろう...」という感じで、首をかしげたような感じがいいと思います。光輪や翼は入れないでください。普段着ている白いトップスの代わりに、好きな黄色の晴れ着を着て描いてもいいと思います。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/ok1hyn9i6zt0wk2/Liminality%20ref%20sheet%20jp.png?dl=0", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 53772, "client_id": 1331093, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c713f2d/uploads/origins/a1a6864b-632f-41a6-983d-8d2df5594565?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52be902fc20f8876d545c5cbf8ea6eac", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c713f2d/uploads/origins/a1a6864b-632f-41a6-983d-8d2df5594565?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff682ba3e04e59de0b68f3b2bac64ad6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "以前からTwitterを拝見しており、過去にVA-11 HALL-Aのジルのイラストを描かれたことがあり、とても気に入っています。同じようなイラストを、VA-11 HALL-Aのベアトリス・アルバートで描いていただけないかと思ったのですが、いかがでしょうか？\n\n参考URLにイラストをリンクしておきました。\nアリガトウ！（笑\n\nhttps://fxtwitter.com/asakirikoko/status/1314192639906906113", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 53772, "client_id": 965674, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2385b898/uploads/origins/6b0d4a5c-cf8b-4856-a288-f9f1aff8d283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d54a52e9f1f44deffd859db275bdc1ca", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2385b898/uploads/origins/6b0d4a5c-cf8b-4856-a288-f9f1aff8d283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b3db87ead8730a1533ba0cd97173800a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! \n\nI'd love to request on original character design for a kuudere swamp witch. It'd be nice if she had a few monstrous limbs or features, like her body has started to mutate into sharing features with swamp wildlife (gators, leeches, etc) due to intense experimentation.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 53772, "client_id": 52952, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/805d23cc/uploads/origins/f2bf8f8b-b164-4d11-96dd-c3a817d7f42f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44b103809f9cbdb9fdc58256bc8db7ed", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/805d23cc/uploads/origins/f2bf8f8b-b164-4d11-96dd-c3a817d7f42f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ee509ba86d6216d3ce645c8889be869e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "VRchatというゲームで使っているアバターのラッシュラップを描いてください。\n資料をURLに添付します。\n\n訓練中に本気になってしまって、倒した相手に冷たい表情を向けている場面を相手視点でお願いします。\nふとした時に普段とは違う兵士らしい冷血な一面を隠し持っていることに気づいて、背筋が寒くなるようなキャラが好きです。\n\nhttp://nand74132.sblo.jp/article/189021515.html", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 53772, "client_id": 188731, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/65203bd7/uploads/origins/07a35eeb-7176-466e-a9c9-4961de8ec59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=096dd050b273479ab23da7ca76309827", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/65203bd7/uploads/origins/07a35eeb-7176-466e-a9c9-4961de8ec59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=651a7f0217b31256d73496182e4a691b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "廃棄された異性体ちゃんのイラストレーションが見たいです\n\n構図等はお任せします", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 53772, "client_id": 177871, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1dda3fb/uploads/origins/9995302e-061d-4372-a099-77134eb14205?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f8cff8b4df4462854a478cf3a68453a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f1dda3fb/uploads/origins/9995302e-061d-4372-a099-77134eb14205?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w